### Geocoding Service API Examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

# ============================================================================
# Feature Flags
# ============================================================================

### Check which features are enabled (vectors, AI)
GET http://localhost:8000/features

###

# ============================================================================
# Autocomplete Endpoint (Typesense)
# Fast prefix/typo-tolerant search with geo-biasing
# ============================================================================

### Basic autocomplete - short prefix search
GET http://localhost:8000/autocomplete?q=cai

###

### Autocomplete with location bias (Cairo coordinates)
GET http://localhost:8000/autocomplete?q=cairo&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=5

###

### Autocomplete without vector search (faster, text-only)
GET http://localhost:8000/autocomplete?q=cairo&limit=5&vector=false

###

### Autocomplete with custom limit
GET http://localhost:8000/autocomplete?q=tahrir&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=20

###

### Autocomplete for different query types
GET http://localhost:8000/autocomplete?q=pyramids&lat=29.9792&lon=31.1342&limit=10

###

### Autocomplete with typo tolerance
GET http://localhost:8000/autocomplete?q=kahira&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=5

###

# ============================================================================
# Geocode Endpoint (Elasticsearch)
# Full-text search with vector similarity, geo decay, and ranking
# ============================================================================

### Basic geocode search
GET http://localhost:8000/geocode?q=valeo

###

### Geocode with geo-distance decay (near Pyramids)
GET http://localhost:8000/geocode?q=pyramids&lat=29.9792&lon=31.1342&limit=5

###

### Geocode with location bias (Cairo area)
GET http://localhost:8000/geocode?q=tahrir square&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=10

###

### Geocode without vector search (faster, text-only)
GET http://localhost:8000/geocode?q=alexandria&limit=10&vector=false

###

### Geocode with custom result limit
GET http://localhost:8000/geocode?q=nile&limit=20

###

### Geocode for specific place types
GET http://localhost:8000/geocode?q=restaurant&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=15

###

### Geocode with fuzzy matching (typo tolerance)
GET http://localhost:8000/geocode?q=kahira&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=5

###

# ============================================================================
# Feedback Endpoint
# Popularity feedback loop to boost future rankings
# ============================================================================

### Boost popularity for a place (default boost: 1.0)
POST http://localhost:8000/feedback?osm_id=n271613766&boost=1.0

###

### Boost popularity with custom boost value
POST http://localhost:8000/feedback?osm_id=n271613766&boost=5.0

###

# ============================================================================
# Elasticsearch Direct Access (for debugging)
# ============================================================================

### Count documents in Elasticsearch index
GET http://localhost:9200/osm_places/_count

###

### Get mapping for Elasticsearch index
GET http://localhost:9200/osm_places/_mapping

###

### Search Elasticsearch directly (raw query)
POST http://localhost:9200/osm_places/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": {
      "name": "cairo"
    }
  },
  "size": 5
}

###

# ============================================================================
# Typesense Direct Access (for debugging)
# ============================================================================

### Search Typesense collection directly
GET http://localhost:8108/collections/osm_places/documents/search?q=cairo&query_by=name,name_en,tags_text&per_page=5
X-TYPESENSE-API-KEY: typesense-secret-key

###

### Get Typesense collection schema
GET http://localhost:8108/collections/osm_places
X-TYPESENSE-API-KEY: typesense-secret-key

###
http://localhost:8108/health